      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-bottom:6pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:174%">Account balances presented in the financial statements (pages 110 and 122) and on the accompanying schedules do not include AFUDC equity at the approved Rate of Return on Equity of 14% per Docket No. CP97-168 ("Mainline") and 12.99% ROE on the Tioga Lateral per Docket No. CP13-21-000. Account balances include the negotiated rate of 10.88% Return on Equity which was effective December 1, 2000 to November 30, 2015.</span>
      </div>
